{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Propagate fatal MDC restoration failures to the invocation caller.** If asynchronous `restore.close()` throws a direct or wrapped `VirtualMachineError`/`ThreadDeath`, this `finally` completes `result` with the selected success or pending output before the fatal escapes only the worker. Complete `result` exceptionally with the fatal before rethrowing it, and update the asynchronous restoration test to assert that the caller observes the same fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77SWvc","finding_digest":"a8a5f7ee99e36de816ae84d724372ba5f0fbe07fc30d2240629bc066a8777415","finding_id":"arf_v1_vcs7p3uz4nw6qfvoqtlsinzlux","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::async-mdc-restoration-fatal-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::async-mdc-restoration-fatal-propagation","line":283,"observation_digest":"467caa46d256e28014864229ae431b1248cee68b7afa2fd7311b71c108877572","observation_id":"aro_v1_iz6kurwsk3riafegiiu24qy3cj","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_vcs7p3uz4nw6qfvoqtlsinzlux","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:58:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gtbxvfip6k22jt6q5liwfp2oh4","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"c0d7e060cdac84d1d95afb7ec19c7a247845d294","reviewer":"codex","start_line":283,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_d7hfe6hnp2nkfiodfuy3pvpogc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:58:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
